- Rhonas unblocked deals 5 damage\n\
- Spectral Hunt-Caller (4) blocks Vedalken Engineer (1) - Engineer dies, but creature still deals damage!\n\
\n\
Actually, in Magic, blocked creatures still deal their combat damage to the blocking creature, not the opponent (unless they have trample). Spectral Hunt-Caller doesn't have trample listed.\n\
\n\
Wait, let me reread. Spectral Hunt-Caller CAN give itself and other creatures +1/+1 and trample, but only with the activated ability {5}{G}.\n\
