\n\
Actually, Might of the Masses just makes a creature get +1/+1 for each creature I control. That doesn't give trample. I need a different approach.\n\
\n\
Let me cast **Spectral Hunt-Caller's** ability {5}{G} to give ALL creatures +1/+1 and trample! That way, the next attack will have trample. But wait, we're still in this combat phase.\n\
\n\
